Need to calculate concrete, paint, materials, dimensions, torque, electrical values or convert units?

PracticalCalc puts practical calculators for construction, DIY, workshop and technical work in one fast, easy-to-use app.

Whether you're working on a home improvement project, estimating construction materials, checking a mechanical calculation or solving a technical problem, PracticalCalc helps you get an answer in seconds.

CONSTRUCTION CALCULATORS

Calculate quantities and dimensions for common construction and renovation tasks:

• Concrete volume and slab calculations
• Material quantities and waste
• Area and volume
• Paint quantity and coverage
• Tile and flooring quantities
• Roof slope and related measurements
• Construction dimensions and estimates

CONCRETE CALCULATOR

Estimate concrete volume and related quantities for slabs and other common shapes.

Enter your dimensions, calculate the required volume and quickly review the result.

DIY & HOME IMPROVEMENT

Useful calculators for:

• Room and surface measurements
• Paint estimates
• Flooring and tiles
• Material quantities
• Area and volume
• Project measurements

MECHANICAL & WORKSHOP CALCULATORS

Practical tools for workshop and mechanical calculations:

• Torque calculator
• RPM and speed calculations
