• Speed, power and other technical units

FAST, SIMPLE AND OFFLINE

PracticalCalc is designed for quick answers.

Enter your values, calculate, and get the result without unnecessary steps.

Core calculators work offline, so you can use them at home, in the workshop, on a construction site or anywhere without an internet connection.

YOUR TOOLS IN ONE PLACE

• Search calculators instantly
• Save your most-used calculators to Favorites
• Quickly access recently used tools
• Keep calculation history on your device
• Switch between metric and imperial units
• Use the same app for construction, DIY, mechanical, electrical and geometry calculations

NO ACCOUNT REQUIRED

You don't need to create an account or register to use PracticalCalc.

Core calculation data such as calculation history and favorites are stored locally on your device. PracticalCalc does not operate a cloud backend for this data.

FREE TO USE

PracticalCalc is free to use and supported by advertising.

IMPORTANT

Calculation results are intended for estimation, planning and informational purposes. For construction, electrical, mechanical or other safety-critical applications, verify results against applicable standards, regulations, manufacturer specifications and professional guidance.

